## Project structure

```
api/
├── docs/                                   # Flow docs, AI access policy, project overlays
└── specs/v1/
    ├── openapi.yaml                        # REST API root
    ├── asyncapi.yaml                       # AsyncAPI root
    ├── common/                             # Shared OpenAPI components
    │   ├── enums.yaml                      # Project role enum + shared enums
    │   ├── parameters/
    │   ├── responses/
    │   ├── headers/
    │   └── securitySchemes/
    ├── async-common/                       # Shared async components
    │   ├── channels/
    │   │   └── application-events.yaml     # Shared event topic ({project}.events)
    │   ├── message-traits/
    │   └── operation-traits/
    └── domains/
        └── {initial-domain}/               # One folder per bounded context
            ├── models/                     # OpenAPI schemas (entities + derivatives)
            ├── operations/                 # REST operation files
            ├── events/                     # Event snapshots + context shapes
            ├── messages/                   # AsyncAPI event/job message files
            ├── channels/                   # Scheduled-trigger channels (event topic is shared)
            ├── async-operations/           # on-* / run-* / emit-* operations
            └── scenarios/                  # Arazzo scenario files (*.arazzo.yaml)
```

Cross-cutting Arazzo recipes and scenarios live under `api/specs/v1/scenarios/` (see the Arazzo handbook §3.1 for the full directory layout).

