## Claude Code workflow

This project's `.claude/agents/` and `.claude/commands/` are copies of the kit's `claude-assets/`. To start designing:

| Task | Command |
|---|---|
| Design a new REST endpoint | (no kit command yet — author by hand following `<kit>/handbooks/API_Handbook.md`) |
| Design a new async flow (events, scheduled jobs) | `/design-async` |
| Design a new Arazzo scenario | `/design-scenario` |
| Design a new setup recipe | `/design-recipe` |
| Validate scenario files | `/validate-scenarios` |
| Validate AsyncAPI specs | `/validate-async` |
| List existing scenarios | `/list-scenarios` |
| Bundle specs for the generator | `/bundle` |
| Generate code from specs | `/generate` |

See `<kit>/claude-assets/commands/` for the full command list with descriptions.

When the kit ships updated agents/commands, refresh this project's copies:

```bash
<kit>/templates/project-init/init.sh --refresh-assets $(pwd)
```

